OL,3,GNEWSAVet to run 385 miles across Sri
OL,4,ALanka for hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vet who gave up her life in the UK to
OL,7,Fcare for injured street animals in Sri
OL,8,FLanka is to run the 385-mile (620km)
OL,9,Flength of the country to raise money
OL,10,Ffor a #1.6m new hospital.
OL,12,FDr Janey Lowes, from Barnard Castle,
OL,13,FCounty Durham, will do the 'Dog Jog'
OL,14,Fchallenge on 9 October from Point Pedro
OL,15,Fdown to Dondra, which she hopes to
OL,16,Fcomplete in 22 days.
OL,18,FLowes said there was a "need" for the
OL,19,Fcharity which she founded, WeCare
OL,20,FWorldwide in 2014, to move into a
OL,21,Fpurpose-built facility as it had
OL,22,Foutgrown its "makeshift" clinic.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
